zApp is a C++ portable Application 
Framework which provides programmers 
over 200 classes that perform tasks like 
Windows, Dialogs, Controls, Menus, 
Fonts, Bitmaps, Forms, MDI, Printing, 
Window Positioning, Memory 
Management, etc.  With single source 
code compatibility, zApp provides you 
with portability between Windows, 
Windows NT, DOS Text, DOS Graphics, 
OS/2 and soon X/Motif.  Source code 
included, no royalties.

